what's inside my mind

00:02:30.035 --> 00:02:32.926
when I see what's going on
in the current state of media

00:02:32.926 --> 00:02:35.170
and the current state of healthcare.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:40.170
(piano twinkle music)

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:41.240
Alrighty so,

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:45.040
